# Attuned Hunter counts only cards leaving YOUR graveyard: on Bot1's turn 3 Bot2 exiles its own graveyard (a spent Black Lotus) with Tormod's Crypt, and the 3/3 stays a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Attuned Hunter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Tormod's Crypt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Attuned Hunter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Tormod's Crypt.Activate(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Attuned Hunter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Attuned Hunter.Power = 3
